@page "/vek/project/sponsor"

<DocsPage DisplayFooter="true">
    <DocsPageHeader Title="Support Vek" SubTitle="Help sustain an open-source component library for Blazor." />
    <DocsPageContent>
        <DocsPageSection>
            <SectionHeader Title="Help Vek keep growing">
                <Description>
                    <VekText>Vek is free to use and built in the open. Maintaining a component library takes ongoing work across code, documentation, accessibility, infrastructure, and compatibility with new .NET and Blazor versions.</VekText>
                    <VekText>Your sponsorship helps fund that work. It gives the team more room to maintain the project, improve existing components, fix reported issues, and build features that benefit the wider community.</VekText>
                </Description>
            </SectionHeader>
        </DocsPageSection>

        <DocsPageSection>
            <SectionHeader Title="Become a Vek sponsor">
                <Description>
                    <VekText>If Vek is useful to you or your organization, you can help support its continued development through Open Collective. Choose a contribution that works for you; every sponsorship helps us invest more time in the project.</VekText>
                    <VekButton DropShadow="false" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.DataUsage" IconColor="Color.Info" Size="Size.Large" Variant="Variant.Filled" Class="docs-no-text-transform" Href="https://opencollective.com/vek" Target="_blank">Sponsor Vek on Open Collective</VekButton>
                </Description>
            </SectionHeader>
        </DocsPageSection>

        <DocsPageSection>
            <SectionHeader Title="Support the project in other ways">
                <Description>
                    <VekText>Financial support is one way to help. You can also contribute code or documentation through the <VekLink Href="/vek/community/contribution">contribution guide</VekLink>, or help us improve Vek by <VekLink Href="/vek/community/reporting-bugs">reporting a bug</VekLink>.</VekText>
                </Description>
            </SectionHeader>
        </DocsPageSection>
    </DocsPageContent>
</DocsPage>
